  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "O Três de Paus fala de visão, empreendimento e horizontes.",
      "Ele representa a base firme de onde se parte para o novo.",
      "O foco dele é: ampliar o alcance sem perder contato consigo."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Three of Wands speaks of vision, enterprise and horizons.",
      "It stands for firm ground from which to set out for the new.",
      "Its focus: widening your reach without losing touch with yourself."
    ]
  },
